# niyama.cyr -- bundled distribution (placeholder)
# Version: 0.1.0
# Status:  M0 scaffold — no engines shipped yet.
#
# This file is the fold-ready single-include artifact for niyama.
# Following the sandhi precedent (cyrius v5.7.0 vendored
# `dist/sandhi.cyr` byte-identical as `lib/sandhi.cyr`), once niyama
# hits v1.0 with multi-consumer adoption, cyrius stdlib will vendor
# this file as `lib/niyama.cyr` per niyama ADR 0001.
#
# For now this is just a marker — the actual engine modules
# (`src/bre.cyr`, `src/re2.cyr`, `src/pcre.cyr`, `src/fuzzy.cyr`,
# `src/vim.cyr`) will be bundled here at each milestone via
# `cyrius distlib` (sandhi reference).
#
# Do not edit -- rebuild with: cyrius distlib (post-M1)

var NIYAMA_VERSION = "0.1.0";
